# LONG-ONLY — no shorting

Q-Alpha / Peak Hour Performers / UTS / TSD is a **long-only** system.

## Locked

- Entry action is always **BUY**. Never place intentional short entries (`SELL` to open).
- Do not add short-selling strategies, inverse ETFs as shorts, or sell-to-open stock legs.
- Ignore SELL/short signal dots from indicators — exits are flatten/cover of longs only.
- A broker short (e.g. orphan `qty < 0`) is **cleanup only** (cover to flat), not a strategy.

## Allowed SELL

- Closing or reducing an existing **long** (trail, kill, time-cap, flatten).
- Canceling working exit orders on longs.

## Not allowed

```python
# BAD — intentional short
MarketOrder("SELL", qty)  # with no long to close
# GOOD — long entry
MarketOrder("BUY", qty)
# GOOD — exit long / cover orphan short to flat
MarketOrder("SELL", long_qty)  # or BUY to cover qty < 0 cleanup
```
